{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23746","headline":"送鹤与裴相临别赠诗 · 白居易","name":"送鹤与裴相临别赠诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"司空爱尔尔须知，不信听吟送鹤诗。\n羽翮势高宁惜别，稻粱恩厚莫愁饥。\n夜栖少共鸡争树，晓浴先饶凤占池。\n稳上青云勿回顾，的应胜在白家时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}